# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The studio vault — ignore rules
#
# This folder IS an Obsidian vault. Obsidian writes machine-local state and
# plugin secrets into it as a side effect of normal use. Nothing below is
# something you authored — it is state, cache, or credentials.
#
# Vault *settings* are portable and worth versioning; vault *state* and anything
# a plugin stores on your behalf are not.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Plugin settings live in data.json, and that is where API keys land. Ignored by
# default; a plugin whose settings you want versioned can be force-added:
#   git add -f .obsidian/plugins/x/data.json
.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
credentials.json
*_token
*.token
.netrc

# ── Obsidian machine-local state ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/cache
.obsidian/graph.json
.obsidian/hotkeys.json.bak
.trash/
.obsidian/trash/

# ── Local AI / embedding caches ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# A vectorized copy of every note: the whole vault in another form.
.smart-env/
.smart-connections/
.obsidian/plugins/*/vectors/
.rag/
.rag_index/
rag_index/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
embeddings/
*.embeddings.json

# ── Sync conflicts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo sits in a OneDrive folder.
*.sync-conflict-*
*conflicted copy*
.obsidian/sync.json

# ── Private notes (convention, opt-in) ───────────────────────────────────────
_private/
*.private.md

# ── OS / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
*.swp
